<title>USA: Thiokol Corp adopts new rights plan.</title>
<headline>Thiokol Corp adopts new rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>ODGEN, Utah 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thiokol Corp said on Thursday that its directors had adopted a new shareholders' rights plan and redeemed the company's existing rights.</p>
<p>The new rights will be issued on May 30 and will expire on May 30, 2007, unless redeemed, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>A summary of the new rights will be filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission and mailed to stockholders, the company said.</p>
<p>Thiokol Corp is a producer of solid propulsion systems, ordnance and composite products.</p>
</text>
